  "generalAbilities": [
    {
      "name": "Husk Mind",
      "actions": null,
      "traits": [
        "primal"
      ],
      "description": "<p>Elindrians can communicate nearly instantaneously via a primal bond similar to a formian hive mind. While within telepathic range of at least one other elindrian with husk mind, an elindrian acolyte gains a +2 circumstance bonus to initiative rolls, Perception checks, and saving throws against mental effects. If one elindrian is aware of a combatant, all members of the husk mind within range are aware of it.</p>\n<p>The elindrian's husk mind is integrated with their scent; for purposes of detecting other elindrians, formians, undead, or corpses, their scent is a precise sense, rather than imprecise.</p>\n<p>An elindrian always knows the precise distance and direction to the Terror of Ukulam, so long as they're on the same plane of existence.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    }
  ],
